   "type": "intro",
   "start": 0.1,
   "end": 16.462,
   "audioStart": 0.0,
   "text": "Welcome to this financial update for Industries Qatar. In the second quarter of 2026, the industrial conglomerate faced a challenging operating environment. Revenue fell sharply and the group swung into the red amid lower sales volumes and regional shipping disruptions.",
   "data": {
    "kicker": "Quarterly results",
    "company": "Industries Qatar",
    "period": "Q2 2026"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "type": "kpis",
   "start": 18.028,
   "end": 44.841,
   "audioStart": 17.928,
   "text": "During the second quarter of 2026, revenue stood at QR 1.7 billion, which was down 58 percent compared to the first quarter of 2026. Industries Qatar posted a net loss of QR 518 million. In the first quarter of 2026, the company generated QR 4.2 billion in revenue, recorded a net profit of QR 734 million, and delivered earnings per share of QR 0.12.",
