   "type": "trend",
   "start": 46.444,
   "end": 79.107,
   "audioStart": 46.344,
   "text": "Looking at the broader trend, performance across the first half of 2026 shows a marked deceleration. For the first half of 2026, revenue reached QR 5.9 billion, while the group recorded a net profit of QR 216 million, yielding earnings per share of QR 0.04. Net profit was down 89 percent compared to the first half of 2025, when Industries Qatar posted a net profit of QR 2 billion. Over the full year 2025, the group recorded a net profit of QR 4.3 billion.",
