     }
    ],
    "period": "H1 2026",
    "title": "Revenue by segment"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "type": "outlook",
   "start": 144.412,
   "end": 174.225,
   "audioStart": 144.312,
   "text": "Despite quarterly challenges, Industries Qatar maintains a solid financial position. The company carries no long-term debt, and liquidity remains strong. Cash and bank balances stood at QR 8.6 billion at the end of the first half of 2026, compared to QR 8.4 billion at the close of the first quarter of 2026. The group also completed its scheduled dividend distribution. Looking ahead, market watchers will track export logistics and commodity price movements.",
